<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Aisaia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aisaia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Aisaia</para>
  <para style="mt">Aisaia</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14" />Aisaia yegl dugwa, Yawe yene kimagl diu ta eran, ene kanaiglmedi yegl erabuka, abai ta ege swara ta kumugl yagl bogl paikraiglkwa dane panan, yagl gak ta kurabuka. Kuglsre, ye kagie Emanuel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Emanuel mabuno paugwa, God no munara moglkwa.</char></note> we dinabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ISA 7:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7" />Ye Devit gawamo ta moglsre, Devit okna ibo sia king mina ame di mogl, yoba sugl moglmere yegl morabuka. Ye king aimadi kamin morabuka. Moran, ye yoba sugl morabuka i aimadi u mere kide pi meglbi, ye kuda boglkre, deno mudno wida dinabuka. Te, ye mabuno bogl yoba sugl mogl, ede pi aimadi kamin sugl morabuka i, ye mabuno du ya wakai keme ersre, yoba sugl morabuka. Yawe, God Yobuglo Podo Paugwa i, ye yobama dem muduo norukwa pre taragl mudu i plau dinabedi erabuka.<verse eid="ISA 9:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5" />Yawe yegl dugwa, Aya, dumo Asiria we, u kide enabiwa. U kide enabuka ba erme we, yoba kuba idre, yoba simere mere yegl, na dena podo kubrisre, Asiria yoba idre, yoba ta ere sinagledi prika i, ere siga. <verse eid="ISA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6" />Ana na yobanama we, ye mokono narikwa pre dena podo boglkwa. Dena podo boglkwa pre na Asiria yoba dedibo, ye na yobanama kuda bogl tedre, taraglno mudu kunogl idre, yoba makan buglkwa egrimere yegl na yobanama egre atne edinaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ISA 10:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2" />Yawe Murubuglomo ye morabara udre, nomane ya yobuglo tenabuka. Tenan, ye nomane podo panan, ka pre yubu sidre, yoba nomane tedre, yobuglo erabuka. Yegl ersre, ye ama Yawe pre kan ersre, pre i mitna edenabuka.<verse eid="ISA 11:2" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Fall of Lucifer" file="FM 009 Fall of Lucifer_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="14.0" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12" />Lusipa yo, ene okna kugl kuri tagna kana abuglage si pai moglmere mere abuglage singa. Ene heven ibo moglsre, yage atne siniwa! Ene yoba yugobono pere pere meglkwa i, kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo etnga ba yoba ede weigwa igne, ede yage maginagle sumere mere yegl yage maginagle siniwa! <verse eid="ISA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13" />Enene nomanen mina yegl we di pitnga, Na we, na ede mitna pi, heven ibo moglsre, God kugl kuri ere yogwa, paimara mitna ibo siana padraglka. Na muglo ibo ta nigl bre kra yogwa, makai sigwa dumo i ama mitna ibo ame di moraglka. <verse eid="ISA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14" />Na kamun kua sumara mitna ibo pidre, God Mogl Mitna Kaima Edugwa mere yegl moraluwe di, yegl we di pitnga.<verse eid="ISA 14:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6" />Na kanige eriko, yoba na mokona mina duglnai sidre, paunana yugo ake gudigwa. Te, ye na ka narsre, eur si gumana drana wagle edigo, na gumana drana ake kegl dikre, kanige erika.<verse eid="ISA 50:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3" />Yoba ye kide pre tedre, mokono ye teigwa. Ye dem muduo yubun dogwa yagle moglsre, yubun kane kane pre kan erukwa. Yoba ye kide pre tedre, mokono ye tedre, kanakriko, nono ama ye yagl kade moglmedi kankrumga. <verse eid="ISA 53:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4" />Nono prumga i, God yene ere mogl, yubun tenagledi prisre, ye ere sumedi prumga. Yegl prumga ba i ta manugwa. Nono yubuno ya giuglno ye idre, giugl pre norukwa. <verse eid="ISA 53:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5" />Te, yoba ye ere kide ere tedre, sigo, boglkwa i, nono tadaglmeno pre boglkwa. Te, ye nono kumapno idre, yubun yugwa i pre nono wakai munga. Ye sigo, boglkwa i pre nono u kor omniwa.<verse eid="ISA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">*************************</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7" />Yoba ye yagl i mabuno kide ere tedre, yubun podo teigwa ba ye ka ta dikrukwa. Yoba sipsip si goramnedi kane kogl i ede eimere ye yegl si kane si i ede eigwa. I ede eigwa ba yoba sipsip nagie yugo baiglkwa igne, sipsip be dikrumere ye yegl mere ka ta dikrukwa.<verse eid="ISA 53:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9" />Yoba ere mogl, yagl i yagl mabuno kide beglkwa bogl akie maugl sinamnedi di padiglkwa. Yegl di padiglkwa ba ye ka kibi ta dikre, yoba ta sikrukwa pre ye yagl ta mige moni mere kan yogwa giglmo pene wagle yeigwa.<verse eid="ISA 53:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12" />God yegl dugwa, Ana yoba ye tadaglme yoba moglmedi prikwa ba ye yoba mere tadaglmeno kumapmo idre, tadaglme yoba i pre kamage ere narsre, ye yene na na si goraiglmedi togwa pre yagl kade kagno wanimere na ye sigie kagie wanabedi ere edenaglka. Te, soldia ye kudano ikne yobuglo ere tedre, taraglno yubu si imere mere yegl, na ye taragl mere yubu si inabedi ere edenagle di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ISA 53:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53" />
</usx>